{
 "encounter_id": "00903",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "NURSE"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I don't know what happened. I was in the shopping centre and then I was on the floor and people were standing over me."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That must have been frightening. I'm glad you're here. What's the last thing you remember before it happened?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I was walking, and I felt a bit hot, and my vision went sort of grey."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And the next thing you remember? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A lady holding my hand. And the ambulance people. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Doctor, the ambulance crew said he was out for about a minute, and a bystander saw no shaking."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. Did you bite your tongue or lose control of your bladder?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Did you have chest pain, or a racing heart before?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No chest pain. My heart wasn't racing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you eaten today? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Not really. A coffee this morning, that's all. I was in a rush. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And have you fainted before? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Never. This is the first time. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you take any tablets?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Tamsulosin in the evenings, I can't remember the strength. And a baby aspirin, 75 mg, in the morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you have any medical problems?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "An enlarged prostate. That's it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Doctor, I've done his observations on arrival. Pulse 62, blood pressure 108 over 64 sitting, temperature 36.4, oxygen 98 percent, breathing 16."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. Let me check it standing as well, if you're steady. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'll try.",
   "pause": 18.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Standing blood pressure is 92 over 58, and you feel light-headed? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes. A little, yes. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That drop explains it. I think you fainted because your pressure dropped on standing, with not eating, and the tamsulosin."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it serious? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Usually not, but I want to be sure about your heart, so I'll record a heart tracing now and take blood."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll take you through to the bay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Please drink fluids and have something to eat before you leave."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will. Thank you. ~"
  }
 ],
